Add to the WeaverPanel.svelte `<style>` block:

```css
@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .role-row {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 8px;
  }
  .role-name { font-weight: 600; }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .status-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
```

